{"id":"cintura","lemma":"cintura","pos":"noun","rank":4149,"glosses":["waist"],"ipa":"/θinˈtuɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"cinturas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-cintura.wav","examples":[{"text":"El agua le llegó hasta su cintura.","en":"The water came up to his waist.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"water"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},{"g":"until"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"El hombre llevaba un arma en la cintura.","en":"The man wore a gun on his hip.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/635471","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"man"},{"g":"to take somewhere","l":"llevar"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"weapon, arm"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"¿Cuál es tu medida de cintura?","en":"What's your waist size?","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"measurement"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Él estaba desnudo de cintura hacia arriba.","en":"He was bare to the waist.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706573","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"naked, nude, undressed"},{"g":"of / from"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"upwards, upward, up"]]},{"text":"Hay que meter en cintura a ese chico.","en":"That child has to be restrained.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to put in, insert"},{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"boy"}]}]}